Revision history for Uniform::Upload

0.02  2026-08-23
        - Abstracted Uniform::Upload as a base class for extension drivers.
        - Added constructor delegation support (SUPER::new) for framework drivers.
        - Added max_size limit string normalization (e.g., accepting '2MB' alongside '2M').
        - Added full POD documentation and inheritance guides for subclasses.
        - Added comprehensive test suite (t/00-load.t through t/03-inheritance.t).
        - Added examples/demo.pl demonstration script.

0.01  2026-08-22
        - Repository specification abstraction initialize launch.
        - Fluid validation instance file wrapper tracking engine stabilized.
